        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IW4BI / IW4BD, Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe arched ends of the Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Entryset gives it a classic feel. That along with the egg knob makes this handleset perfect for traditional homes. It has a black finish that mimics the texture of weathered iron for an old world touch. A mortise lock, it is for 1-3/4\" to 3\" thick doors with a 2-3/4\" backset.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/forged-iron-egg-knob-acorn-iuqbd\"><b>Forged Iron Egg Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a knob from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside knob will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Entryset, Acorn IW4BD / IW4BI",
                "description": "Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Lockset Acorn IW4B - The arched ends of the Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Entryset gives it a classic feel. That along with the egg knob makes this handleset perfect for traditional homes. It has a black finish that mimics the texture of weathered iron for an old world touch. A mortise lock, it is for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Entrysets, Egg Knob Mortise Cylinder Locksets, Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Entrysets, single cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Mortise Cylinder Locksets, mortise lock handlesets, mortise handlesets, Acorn IW3BI, ACO-IW4BI, Acorn IW4BD, Acorn IW4BI / IW4BD, egg knobs, arched handlesets, Acorn IW4BD / IW4BI"
